OL,3,GNEWSATribute to 'cheeky big brother'
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a 16-year-old boy who
OL,7,Fdied after being involved in a crash
OL,8,Fsay he will be remembered as a "cheeky
OL,9,Fbig brother".
OL,11,FOscar Mason was a passenger in a
OL,12,FVolkswagen Polo which hit a tree next
OL,13,Fto the A4104, in Defford,
OL,14,FWorcestershire, at about 21:20 BST on
OL,15,F12 September, and was later pronounced
OL,16,Fdead at the scene.
OL,18,FPaying tribute, Mason's family said he
OL,19,Fwas "truly the most amazing boy" and
OL,20,Fdescribed him as "smart, caring and
OL,21,Falways willing to help others".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
